{"title": "Crowning Glory", "pageid": 28334, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crowning_Glory", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Crowning Glory</b> is a passive feature that heals the wearer when they heal others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When healing another, the wearer regains <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wapira%27s_Crown\" title=\"Wapira's Crown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Wapiras_Crown_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wapira%27s_Crown\" title=\"Wapira's Crown\">Wapira's Crown</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Crowning Glory activates on healing <i>others</i>, not the wearer.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9398/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2644/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754652/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.709      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.709      1 -total\n 30.51%   10.588      1 Template:DamageText\n 29.06%   10.088      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 27.15%    9.425      1 Template:Damage_type\n 26.29%    9.125      1 Template:Icon_link\n 25.97%    9.013     12 Template:Trim\n 25.38%    8.810      1 Template:Icon_text\n 22.69%    7.877      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 21.71%    7.534      